msgstr "Zmiany funkcji w Qiskit v1.0 {#qiskit-v10-feature-changes}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide describes migration paths for the most important feature changes in Qiskit v1.0, organized by module.\n"
"Use the table of contents on the right side to navigate to the module you are interested in.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ten przewodnik opisuje ścieżki migracji dla najważniejszych zmian funkcji w Qiskit v1.0, uporządkowanych według modułów.\n"
"Skorzystaj ze spisu treści po prawej stronie, aby przejść do interesującego cię modułu.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit v1.0 migration tool {#qiskit-v10-migration-tool}"
msgstr "Narzędzie migracyjne Qiskit v1.0 {#qiskit-v10-migration-tool}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To ease the migration process, you can use the\n"
"[`flake8-qiskit-migration`](https://github.com/qiskit-community/flake8-qiskit-migration)\n"
"tool to detect removed import paths in your code and suggest alternatives.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aby ułatwić proces migracji, możesz użyć narzędzia\n"
"[`flake8-qiskit-migration`](https://github.com/qiskit-community/flake8-qiskit-migration),\n"
"które wykrywa usunięte ścieżki importów w twoim kodzie i sugeruje alternatywy.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"flake8-pipx\" label=\"Run with pipx\" default>\n"
"      If you have [`pipx`](https://github.com/pypa/pipx) installed, simply run\n"
"      the following command.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"flake8-pipx\" label=\"Uruchom z pipx\" default>\n"
"      Jeśli masz zainstalowane [`pipx`](https://github.com/pypa/pipx), po prostu uruchom\n"
"      następujące polecenie.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      ```sh\n"
"      pipx run flake8-qiskit-migration <path-to-source-directory>\n"
"      ```\n"
"      This will install the package to a temporary virtual environment and run\n"
"      it on your code.\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"flake8-venv\" label=\"Run with venv\" default>\n"
"      If you don't want to use `pipx`, you can manually create a new\n"
"      environment for the tool. This approach also lets you use\n"
"      [`nbqa`](https://github.com/nbQA-dev/nbQA) to check code examples in\n"
"      Jupyter notebooks. Delete the environment when you're finished.\n"
msgstr ""
"      ```sh\n"
"      pipx run flake8-qiskit-migration <path-to-source-directory>\n"
"      ```\n"
"      Spowoduje to zainstalowanie pakietu w tymczasowym środowisku wirtualnym i uruchomienie\n"
"      go na twoim kodzie.\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"flake8-venv\" label=\"Uruchom z venv\" default>\n"
"      Jeśli nie chcesz używać `pipx`, możesz ręcznie utworzyć nowe\n"
"      środowisko dla narzędzia. Takie podejście pozwala też używać\n"
"      [`nbqa`](https://github.com/nbQA-dev/nbQA) do sprawdzania przykładów kodu w\n"
"      notebookach Jupyter. Usuń środowisko po zakończeniu.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      ```sh\n"
"      # Make new environment and install\n"
"      python -m venv .flake8-qiskit-migration-venv\n"
"      source .flake8-qiskit-migration-venv/bin/activate\n"
"      pip install flake8-qiskit-migration\n"
msgstr ""
"      ```sh\n"
"      # Make new environment and install\n"
"      python -m venv .flake8-qiskit-migration-venv\n"
"      source .flake8-qiskit-migration-venv/bin/activate\n"
"      pip install flake8-qiskit-migration\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      # Run plugin on Python code\n"
"      flake8 --select QKT100 <path-to-source-directory>  # e.g. `src/`\n"
msgstr ""
"      # Run plugin on Python code\n"
"      flake8 --select QKT100 <path-to-source-directory>  # e.g. `src/`\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      # (Optional) run plugin on notebooks\n"
"      pip install nbqa\n"
"      nbqa flake8 ./**/*.ipynb --select QKT100\n"
msgstr ""
"      # (Optional) run plugin on notebooks\n"
"      pip install nbqa\n"
"      nbqa flake8 ./**/*.ipynb --select QKT100\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      # Deactivate and delete environment\n"
"      deactivate\n"
"      rm -r .flake8-qiskit-migration-venv\n"
"      ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"      # Deactivate and delete environment\n"
"      deactivate\n"
"      rm -r .flake8-qiskit-migration-venv\n"
"      ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Limitations\">\n"
"This tool only detects removed import paths. It does not detect the use of removed\n"
"methods (such as `QuantumCircuit.qasm`) or arguments. It also can't keep track\n"
"of assignments such as `qk = qiskit`, although it can handle aliases such as\n"
"`import qiskit as qk`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Ograniczenia\">\n"
"To narzędzie wykrywa jedynie usunięte ścieżki importów. Nie wykrywa użycia usuniętych\n"
"metod (takich jak `QuantumCircuit.qasm`) ani argumentów. Nie śledzi też\n"
"przypisań w stylu `qk = qiskit`, choć radzi sobie z aliasami takimi jak\n"
"`import qiskit as qk`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For more information, see the [project's\n"
"repository](https://github.com/qiskit-community/flake8-qiskit-migration).\n"
msgstr ""
"Więcej informacji znajdziesz w [repozytorium\n"
"projektu](https://github.com/qiskit-community/flake8-qiskit-migration).\n"

