# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Most of the functionality in the `qiskit.providers.basicaer` module has been\n"
"replaced with the new\n"
"[`qiskit.providers.basic_provider`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/providers_basic_provider)\n"
"module, except for the `UnitarySimulatorPy` and `StatevectorSimulatorPy`\n"
"classes, which have been removed; their functionality was already contained in\n"
"the [`quantum_info`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/quantum_info) module.\n"
msgstr ""
"Większość funkcjonalności modułu `qiskit.providers.basicaer` została zastąpiona nowym modułem\n"
"[`qiskit.providers.basic_provider`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/providers_basic_provider),\n"
"z wyjątkiem klas `UnitarySimulatorPy` i `StatevectorSimulatorPy`,\n"
"które zostały usunięte; ich funkcjonalność była już zawarta w\n"
"module [`quantum_info`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/quantum_info).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The migration to the new paths is straightforward. You can replace most\n"
"classes in `qiskit.providers.basicaer` with their\n"
"[`qiskit.providers.basic_provider`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/providers_basic_provider)\n"
"counterpart (drop-in replacement). Note that the following classes have\n"
"new paths and names:\n"
msgstr ""
"Migracja do nowych ścieżek jest prosta. Większość klas z `qiskit.providers.basicaer` możesz zastąpić\n"
"ich odpowiednikami z\n"
"[`qiskit.providers.basic_provider`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/providers_basic_provider)\n"
"(zamienniki drop-in). Pamiętaj, że następujące klasy mają\n"
"nowe ścieżki i nazwy:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Removed                          | Alternative\n"
"---------------------------------|--------------------------------------------\n"
"`qiskit.providers.basicaer`                            |  [`qiskit.providers.basic_provider`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/providers_basic_provider)\n"
"`BasicAerProvider`             |  [`BasicProvider`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.basic_provider.BasicProvider)\n"
"`BasicAerJob`                       |  [`BasicProviderJob`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.basic_provider.BasicProviderJob)\n"
"`QasmSimulatorPy`               |  [`BasicSimulator`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.basic_provider.BasicSimulator)\n"
msgstr ""
"Usunięto                         | Alternatywa\n"
"---------------------------------|--------------------------------------------\n"
"`qiskit.providers.basicaer`                            |  [`qiskit.providers.basic_provider`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/providers_basic_provider)\n"
"`BasicAerProvider`             |  [`BasicProvider`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.basic_provider.BasicProvider)\n"
"`BasicAerJob`                       |  [`BasicProviderJob`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.basic_provider.BasicProviderJob)\n"
"`QasmSimulatorPy`               |  [`BasicSimulator`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.basic_provider.BasicSimulator)\n"

