# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "fake_provider {#fake-provider}"
msgstr "fake_provider {#fake-provider}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Most of the user-facing\n"
"`qiskit.providers.fake_provider` components have\n"
"been migrated to the `qiskit-ibm-runtime` Python package. This includes the\n"
"fake provider classes, all of the device-specific fake backends (such as\n"
"`FakeVigo`, `FakeNairobiV2`, and `FakeSherbrooke`), and the fake backend\n"
"base classes. Click through the following tabs to see the affected classes.\n"
msgstr ""
"Większość komponentów `qiskit.providers.fake_provider` widocznych dla użytkownika została\n"
"przeniesiona do pakietu Python `qiskit-ibm-runtime`. Obejmuje to\n"
"klasy fałszywych dostawców, wszystkie fałszywe Backend-y specyficzne dla urządzeń (takie jak\n"
"`FakeVigo`, `FakeNairobiV2` i `FakeSherbrooke`) oraz klasy bazowe fałszywych Backend-ów. Kliknij w poniższe zakładki, aby zobaczyć dotknięte klasy.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"backends\" label=\"Fake Backends\" default>\n"
"      * Any class in `qiskit.providers.fake_provider.backends`\n"
"      * `fake_provider.fake_backend.FakeBackend`\n"
"      * `fake_provider.fake_backend.FakeBackendV2`\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"providers\" label=\"Fake Providers\">\n"
"      * `fake_provider.FakeProvider`\n"
"      * `fake_provider.FakeProviderForBackendV2`\n"
"      * `fake_provider.FakeProviderFactory`\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"backends\" label=\"Fałszywe Backend-y\" default>\n"
"      * Dowolna klasa w `qiskit.providers.fake_provider.backends`\n"
"      * `fake_provider.fake_backend.FakeBackend`\n"
"      * `fake_provider.fake_backend.FakeBackendV2`\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"providers\" label=\"Fałszywi dostawcy\">\n"
"      * `fake_provider.FakeProvider`\n"
"      * `fake_provider.FakeProviderForBackendV2`\n"
"      * `fake_provider.FakeProviderFactory`\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "To migrate to the new path:\n"
msgstr "Aby przeprowadzić migrację do nowej ścieżki:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install `qiskit-ibm-runtime` `0.17.1` or later:\n"
