#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "passmanager {#passmanager}"
msgstr "passmanager {#passmanager}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `append` methods of the\n"
"[`ConditionalController`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.passmanager.ConditionalController),\n"
"[`FlowControllerLinear`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.passmanager.FlowControllerLinear), and\n"
"[`DoWhileController`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.passmanager.DoWhileController) classes\n"
"have been removed. Instead, all tasks must be provided when the controller\n"
"objects are constructed.\n"
msgstr ""
"Metody `append` klas\n"
"[`ConditionalController`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.passmanager.ConditionalController),\n"
"[`FlowControllerLinear`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.passmanager.FlowControllerLinear) i\n"
"[`DoWhileController`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.passmanager.DoWhileController)\n"
"zostały usunięte. Zamiast tego wszystkie zadania muszą być przekazane podczas konstruowania obiektów kontrolera.\n"

